      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Retrievability formula  (src/fsrs.rs \u2014 retrieve())\n\nR  =  ( 1  +  t / (9 \u00d7 S) ) ^ -1\n\n  t = days since last_reviewed\n  S = stability (stored on node)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "2bc2nnuv",
      "originalText": "Retrievability formula  (src/fsrs.rs \u2014 retrieve())\n\nR  =  ( 1  +  t / (9 \u00d7 S) ) ^ -1\n\n  t = days since last_reviewed\n  S = stability (stored on node)",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
