    {
      "id": "t64z7w2s",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 48,
      "y": 218,
      "width": 484,
      "height": 274,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#cbd5e1",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Decay examples  (t at which R = 0.5)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nStability  \u2192  Days until R drops to 0.5\n\nS = 2.0  (new topic, first insertion)\n    t = 9 \u00d7 2 = 18 days \u2192 R=0.5\n    known threshold (R=0.9) crossed at ~2 days\n\nS = 5.0  (reviewed twice, decent answers)\n    t = 9 \u00d7 5 = 45 days \u2192 R=0.5\n    known threshold crossed at ~5.5 days\n\nS = 10.0  (strong repeated understanding)\n    t = 9 \u00d7 10 = 90 days \u2192 R=0.5\n    stays known for ~11 days\n\nS = 999  (domain skeleton node)\n    effectively never decays (R \u2248 1.0 forever)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "6qdy4lmc",
      "originalText": "Decay examples  (t at which R = 0.5)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nStability  \u2192  Days until R drops to 0.5\n\nS = 2.0  (new topic, first insertion)\n    t = 9 \u00d7 2 = 18 days \u2192 R=0.5\n    known threshold (R=0.9) crossed at ~2 days\n\nS = 5.0  (reviewed twice, decent answers)\n    t = 9 \u00d7 5 = 45 days \u2192 R=0.5\n    known threshold crossed at ~5.5 days\n\nS = 10.0  (strong repeated understanding)\n    t = 9 \u00d7 10 = 90 days \u2192 R=0.5\n    stays known for ~11 days\n\nS = 999  (domain skeleton node)\n    effectively never decays (R \u2248 1.0 forever)",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
