    {
      "id": "2xg8p6be",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 48,
      "y": 538,
      "width": 484,
      "height": 224,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#cbd5e1",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Initial retrievability by entry path\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nrocky diff / backfill:\n  stability = 2.0, review_count = 0\n  R = 1.0 at creation (just seen)\n  but created_at may be old (backfill)\n  so R may already be < 0.9 when you first quiz\n\nrocky \"task\" / rocky quiz:\n  added AFTER Q&A \u2014 score sets stability\n  understood \u2192 stability depends on score quality\n  explained \u2192 stability = low (score=0.2)\n\nDomain skeleton nodes:\n  stability = 999  \u2192  R = 1.0 always\n  Never quizzed, just structure",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "3c9xqym5",
      "originalText": "Initial retrievability by entry path\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nrocky diff / backfill:\n  stability = 2.0, review_count = 0\n  R = 1.0 at creation (just seen)\n  but created_at may be old (backfill)\n  so R may already be < 0.9 when you first quiz\n\nrocky \"task\" / rocky quiz:\n  added AFTER Q&A \u2014 score sets stability\n  understood \u2192 stability depends on score quality\n  explained \u2192 stability = low (score=0.2)\n\nDomain skeleton nodes:\n  stability = 999  \u2192  R = 1.0 always\n  Never quizzed, just structure",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
