      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PROPOSED CHANGE  (not yet implemented)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nIf co_authored = true:\n  initial stability = 1.5  (instead of 2.0)\n  initial difficulty = 0.4  (slightly harder)\n\nRationale:\n  AI-generated code = less certain the dev\n  understood it at commit time.\n  Lower starting stability \u2192 topic resurfaces\n  sooner, forcing earlier verification.\n\n\ud83d\udcdd ANNOTATION: Is this the right signal?\nOr should the quiz scheduling be unchanged\nbut the PKG display flag it differently?",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "fflzm764",
      "originalText": "PROPOSED CHANGE  (not yet implemented)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nIf co_authored = true:\n  initial stability = 1.5  (instead of 2.0)\n  initial difficulty = 0.4  (slightly harder)\n\nRationale:\n  AI-generated code = less certain the dev\n  understood it at commit time.\n  Lower starting stability \u2192 topic resurfaces\n  sooner, forcing earlier verification.\n\n\ud83d\udcdd ANNOTATION: Is this the right signal?\nOr should the quiz scheduling be unchanged\nbut the PKG display flag it differently?",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    }
